<description>&lt;p&gt;Aung San Suu Kyi spoke with her son for the first time in over five years, while military commander Min Aung Hlaing met Japan envoy Sasakawa, showing diplomatic engagement amid ongoing fighting. Myanmar airstrikes have intensified, with heavy junta casualties prompting warnings to remain vigilant and displacing civilians from dozens of villages, while bombings in Sittwe silenced streets and drove ticket prices up as people flee to Yangon. A blast in the Rakhine state capital killed at least two people and a bus crash in Mandalay region killed six and injured twelve. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE8tWVd6bUotYTVGSzlmTURESXQ2SHhqLXdXMVRob01Da1hQTDVKbmtNUFNDSm1pU0l5cFlDSjFERk9ZMzdtbkpMc0pVdFVoMWVGM0JrcllmSW8xaDY2S0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOVGdSN0toZHZUdF83RzFxOXg0OU1zVkU1OFJpOTlFVGF5NmFTbWxsUENuNkR4X0tuLXVNSDEyREo0NVMtMGxpampQdDdQQzA4RUJpV3ppemYtR081ZXBOcXBoTVZ2VVNHMHFuOGk1cWxETk9TdG4zTHVuZlFjaVhZQlpnOVV1TzFzcXc5cWIwekkzcS16ek16Zg?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNSWl4SlBja1R4RkhhaTMxemplMld0aldQMmlzbzdsOVlPMnJFWVNwRVVMa1dnanFtOVctTlEyWjl0SnI4Q3I4TzQ4QU5LRjRtX3BKSXc2RE5tQTNRSWhKYXlvX01QdE1OZWlQc1d4ZkZwWWxVQTVGLUR1NWFVWjZYcFNvNDJXS1hOYXUtVWRQSkdwMVZ5MGtUcHpjUTI3TjZ6M0VZaUdhLVdSTzA5UXkyYXlWUTFyRHlXb0tF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPMEoyNTRacGFNellGb0JqTUVRYXNWbWxoZkczZmFuLU1FczhkZEFsYUV6Nk1Iay1Jc2xDc0F0aDFGUEhEZHBHdlFka0p3czBFb0dRSEF4UjRkUnliVERuNkNiVkRmZHhrMnA5US01a3BaZ0o1TG1PMXJWZjNRb1A0bklWNVNvTURROWtYQjl1XzYzMjQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp